  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/gorc1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. 2026-11-01 review (dev 100b6fbb6e): survey of sherpa-onnx c-api emits no OfflineRecognizer class or methods from cxx-api.h; the 3 src_stands_in_for edges are exactly as filed (L126 MoveOnly, L159 if, L807 LinearResampler). Addition: the misparse also mints 15 one-line phantom classes named SHERPA_ONNX_API (e.g. cxx-api.h:392-392:SHERPA_ONNX_API:class). MECHANISM: argument-less export macro between class and name breaks the tree-sitter-cpp parse. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-gafip,WI-tikop."  # 8d69
